 compression syndrome caused by synovial cyst of the hip joint</article-title><source>Z Orthop Ihre Grenzgeb</source><year>1992</year><volume>130</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>128</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1055/s-2008-1040125</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1598769</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Soren</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><article-title>Pathogenesis and treatment of ganglion</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>1966</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5957467</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Steiner</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Steinbach</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>Schnarkowski</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Tirman</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name><name><surname>Genant</surname><given-names>HK</given-names></name><article-title>Ganglia and cysts around joints</article-title><source>Radiol Clin North Am</source><year>1996</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>395</fpage><lpage>425</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8633123</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Akman</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>G&#x000fc;r</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>S&#x000fc;l&#x000fc;n</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Aksoy</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><article-title>A case of a ganglion cyst originating from the hip joint and surgical outcome</article-title><source>Acta Orthop Traumatol Turc</source><year>2002</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>76</fpage><lpage>78</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12510115</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>M&#x000e4;hrlein</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Weiand</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmelzeisen</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><article-title>Ganglion of the hip: report of five cases</article-title><source>J South Orthop Assoc</source><year>2001</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12132836</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Cassina</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hauser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kossmann</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunner</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><article-title>Juxtaacetabular ganglion as a differential diagnosis in pulsating groin masses</article-title><source>Vasa</source><year>2000</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>75</fpage><lpage>76</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1024/0301-1526.29.1.75</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10731893</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Golledge</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Faber</surname><given-names>RGJ</given-names></name><article-title>Hip ganglion: case report and review of the literature</article-title><source>J R Coll Surg Edinb</source><year>1996</year><volume>41</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>405</fpage><lpage>407</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8997031</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Silver</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cassar-Pullicino</surname><given-names>VN</given-names></name><name><surname>Morrissey</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Etherington</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>McCall</surname><given-names>IW</given-names></name><article-title>